<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Fire Mages in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The set bonuses available to Mages in Tier 14 is as simple as it is powerful. Boosting each spec's main proc-based spell - in the case of Fire Mage it's Pyroblast by 8%; as well as reducing the cooldown of Combustion by 20%, giving you more oportunities to cast it within the same fight lengths.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-14">
